[b]RGO Harmony Expanded 0.1.0[/b]

Adds Fruits Expanded RGO values at 949 shared locations where Harmony matches Vanilla and at all 67 approved three-way RGO conflicts. Keeps the base Harmony map and More Locations data, preserves Just Goods 1.1 fixed-location effects, and leaves 71 fruit-replacement cases explicitly unresolved for review.
